- Yeah.

78
00:03:11,191 --> 00:03:14,444
Okay, Ilana, do you take any
prescription medications?

79
00:03:14,528 --> 00:03:16,446
Just Synthroid, one tab a day.

80
00:03:16,530 --> 00:03:18,430
Okay, and any allergies to medications?

81
00:03:18,490 --> 00:03:20,450
- No. No.
- Okay.

82
00:03:20,534 --> 00:03:22,493
Dana will come get you
when the room is ready,

83
00:03:22,577 --> 00:03:24,913
and I'll be back to finish your exam.

84
