<i>Yeah, that's right.</i>

113
00:04:45,285 --> 00:04:48,038
Okay, and which would you say is worse?

114
00:04:51,374 --> 00:04:53,174
<i>My headache was terrible last week...</i>

115
00:04:53,210 --> 00:04:56,170
