Can you run that back again?

118
00:04:59,132 --> 00:05:00,634
<i>Sure.</i>

119
00:05:03,553 --> 00:05:05,722
<i>My headache was terrible last week...</i>

120
00:05:05,806 --> 00:05:09,308
<i>But now my abdominal pain--</i>

