161
00:07:33,370 --> 00:07:36,330
<i>For our address and office hours, press one.</i>

162
00:07:36,414 --> 00:07:39,083
<i>To refill a prescription, press two.</i>

163
00:07:39,167 --> 00:07:43,671
<i>To leave a message for the doctor on call--</i>

164
00:07:43,755 --> 00:07:45,840
Hi, this is
Dr. Baran al-Hashimi.

165
00:07:45,924 --> 00:07:47,758
I'm a patient of Dr. Fairgraves.

166
00:07:47,842 --> 00:07:51,637
