167
00:07:51,721 --> 00:07:54,974
If he's not, I'll take his
next available appointment.

168
00:07:55,058 --> 00:07:58,311
And please call me if he has a cancellation.

169
00:07:58,395 --> 00:08:00,187
Thank you.

170
00:08:00,271 --> 00:08:02,732
Like I said, you're more than
welcome to stay down here

171
