At home, you'll be surrounded by your family

177
00:08:15,245 --> 00:08:18,664
and be more comfortable.

178
00:08:18,748 --> 00:08:20,959
It's your choice, Roxie.

179
00:08:23,003 --> 00:08:25,880
It's not that
I don't wanna go home, but--

180
00:08:25,964 --> 00:08:27,965
- Hi, Mom.
