but I need to collect your clothing first.

203
00:09:37,869 --> 00:09:39,871
Is that okay?

204
00:09:43,666 --> 00:09:46,669
I'm gonna need you to undress
on top of these pads.

205
00:09:46,753 --> 00:09:49,588
Put each item of clothing on the pads, okay?

206
00:09:49,672 --> 00:09:53,259
Then we'll package each piece
in a separate bag.

207
00:09:53,343 --> 00:09:54,385
