209
00:09:55,845 --> 00:09:57,595
Emma's gonna be behind this curtain,

210
00:09:57,597 --> 00:10:00,558
and I'll be in here with you.

211
00:10:00,642 --> 00:10:03,561
And take off your shoes first.

212
