00:10:41,975 --> 00:10:44,769
I can't imagine--her boys.

217
00:10:44,853 --> 00:10:46,479
Oh, don't go there.

218
00:10:46,563 --> 00:10:48,230
I'm gonna see if
I can grease the wheels,

219
00:10:48,314 --> 00:10:49,440
get her a room upstairs soon.

220
