Battle plan for our hall space.

222
00:10:52,944 --> 00:10:54,361
It's filling up fast.

223
00:10:54,445 --> 00:10:56,030
Police officer should be here any minute.

224
00:10:56,114 --> 00:10:58,014
Yeah, well, as soon as you can, please,

225
