562
00:24:20,292 --> 00:24:21,501
No.

563
00:24:21,585 --> 00:24:24,588
He was depressed, had mood swings.

564
00:24:24,672 --> 00:24:26,381
- But he didn't wanna see anyone.
- Oh, my God.

565
00:24:26,465 --> 00:24:28,565
Okay, why am I just now hearing about this?

566
00:24:28,634 --> 00:24:30,927
- Jada, please.
- Please what, Mom?

567
00:24:31,011 --> 00:24:33,889
Why would you not tell Jackson or me?

568
00:24:33,973 --> 00:24:35,348
I can't believe this.

569
